From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Q2 Launcher <engine@q2launcher.invalid>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] web: snddma_web driver and host-pulled audio exports

The mixer paints S16LE stereo into a ring that the launcher pulls with q2l_audio_take. In real time the host reports its play position with q2l_audio_consumed; with q2l_audio_capture on, q2l_step paints exactly the stepped msec of frames, forces the client active and mixes after CL_Frame, so each step paints its own frames. DMA_Update sums the paint-to time in integers so it stays exact past 2^24 frames.
---
 inc/client/sound/dma.h |   7 ++
 meson.build            |   5 +-
 src/client/sound/dma.c |  14 +++-
 src/unix/q2l_step.c    |   9 +++
 src/unix/sound/web.c   | 216 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 249 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

